0..78 Comment "/// This source states the degree `ξ` of a map of the 3-sphere as the winding"
79..97 Comment "/// at its 3-cell."
98..101 Comment "///"
102..175 Comment "/// `wind3` cases on the words at the 3-cell, as `wind` cases on the loop"
176..254 Comment "/// words of the circle. Its `here` arm reads its words from the type that the"
255..287 Comment "/// scrutinee\'s position states."
288..367 Comment "/// `ξ f` is `wind3 (Path.ap f surf3)`, the exponent of the map\'s image of the"
368..379 Comment "/// 3-cell."
380..383 Comment "///"
384..459 Comment "/// The checker converts each degree to its integer, and the kernel replays"
460..479 Comment "/// the conversion."
480..483 Comment "///"
484..562 Comment "/// Limits: `ξ` reads a map that fixes the point by its cases. `Path.ap` of a"
563..635 Comment "/// bound map takes one layer at the 3-cell, so `ξ` takes no bound map."
636..639 Comment "///"
640..690 Comment "/// - see: #6811 — `ξ` over a bound pointed map"
691..771 Comment "/// - see: corpus/model/identity/sphere-maps.gandr — `sphereId3`, the identity"
772..802 Comment "///   of the 3-sphere by cases"
803..880 Comment "/// - see: corpus/model/identity/circle-base.gandr — `wind`, the winding at"
881..900 Comment "///   dimension one"
902..935 Comment "// The 2-sphere and the 3-sphere."
